  <title>5.4.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01299</md:content-id>
    <md:title>5.4.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>1ffc016a-1743-451f-959d-61cf034406e1</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Santos and Sara are checking their work on the following problem: \(4\left(2\cdot3\cdot5\right)^0\).</para>
<para>Santos says the answer is 1. Sara says the answer is 4. Who is correct, and why?</para></section>
</content>
</document>
